    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/5ab6ee51648da719fd91d96f84b9f552.avif?t=1749196239\" width=600 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/be4d909694d43ca7e851dc441465833f.webp?t=1749196239\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a larger, more vibrant world in <i>The Chronicles of Lancelot 2</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b5a84045b75f14cd8084fd5d889bb4d1.avif?t=1749196239\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/aff0111b242fec89bef71ea558baee58.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, you\u2019ll explore the grand castle of Camelot, home to the kingdom's elite. Indulge in luxuries such as the royal theater, steamy saunas, tarot readings, and more. Beyond Camelot, venture into breathtaking new lands, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faldon Village</strong>, Jaime\u2019s tranquil hometown in the sky-bound kingdom of Pantheron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b7615fb48dc98143f9fdbafdb1f8973d.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gay Island Nation of Arcadion</strong>, a utopia of love, pride, and glittering festivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/4098e564471ad8f69ca132193e9236a8.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legendary Island of Avalon</strong>, shrouded in mystery, where ancient treasures and perilous secrets await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d37ae59056458b05b4f3764ec5aef98b.poster.avif?t=1749196239\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d37ae59056458b05b4f3764ec5aef98b.webm?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d37ae59056458b05b4f3764ec5aef98b.mp4?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is teeming with charm, lore, and plenty of surprises to uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b55139becc3ce155f28e55228612624e.avif?t=1749196239\" width=616 height=101 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merlin still struggles against the deadly effects of the Tear of God, leaving the responsibility of ruling the kingdom to the newly public couple, Arthur and Lancelot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/3999e5478a010c49e1e87eeb2bc7aff3.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, peace is short-lived as a dangerous new threat emerges\u2014Mordred, a long-lost adversary of the royal family, has escaped imprisonment and seeks revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As tensions rise and a series of catastrophes unfolds, Arthur, Lancelot, Jaime, and an unlikely ally, Kay, must journey to Avalon to retrieve its magical relics. These ancient artifacts are the key to saving Camelot and restoring balance to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/5730a0dd720d182421f141d74ba99690.avif?t=1749196239\" width=800 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Lancelot and his companions succeed in this perilous quest? Or will Mordred\u2019s vengeance plunge the realm into darkness?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/fd7caa12d0d2d5f6795ad1403b1c7808.avif?t=1749196239\" width=616 height=101 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet old and new faces in this thrilling sequel:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Returning Heroes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/224ab26599b10e1b901da3aef8478ebc.avif?t=1749196239\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The brave yet na\u00efve prince has finally professed his love for Lancelot, but shocking events lead him to imprison his beloved. What could drive him to such a choice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/ad50f252e76fd072810f2060ce86011f.avif?t=1749196239\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing his name and defeating Kay, Lancelot finds himself swept into yet another whirlwind of intrigue, drama, and peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d4b643cd2243166cbb909220cc80dec9.avif?t=1749196239\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a traitor, Kay now finds himself reluctantly aiding Lancelot in the journey to Avalon. Can he earn redemption or will his scheming nature persist?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Allies and Rivals:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lady of the Lake</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.poster.avif?t=1749196239\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.webm?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.mp4?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious figure appears in the form desired by those who seek her. She\u2019s imprisoned deep beneath Avalon, and freeing her will be no small feat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mordred</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.poster.avif?t=1749196239\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.webm?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.mp4?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A master of stealth and deception, Mordred\u2019s family was hunted down by Uther, who adopted him out of guilt. Now, he seeks vengeance for their demise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Takumi</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.poster.avif?t=1749196239\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.webm?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.mp4?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A treasure hunter from the East, Takumi attempts to steal Avalon\u2019s treasure map but gets caught and imprisoned in Camelot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thaloris</strong>: The charismatic merman steward of the Lady of the Lake provides crucial information about Avalon\u2019s treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taliesin</strong>: Camelot\u2019s eccentric scholar invents a flying ship to aid Lancelot on his journey to Pantheron. His poetic wit remains as sharp as ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innika</strong>: A fallen angel bound to the Archangel Ramiel, Innika serves as a reminder of the high cost of redemption.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that\u2019s just the beginning\u2014dozens more intriguing characters await to charm, challenge, and sometimes frustrate you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building on the traditional turn-based RPG mechanics of the first game, <i>The Adventure to Avalon</i> adds exciting new features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Spells and Skills</strong>: Unleash more powerful magic and skills.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/18ea53c02da04efe3eb6ae14be5614a3.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kay as a Playable Ally</strong>: Experience combat from a fresh perspective with Kay\u2019s unique abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/1df10f8e727d48e016d8e4728f493ca8.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games Galore</strong>: Try your hand at treasure hunting, puzzles, or even competing in Avalon\u2019s flamboyant gay festivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Summoning System</strong>: Call upon legendary beings to aid you in battle, each with jaw-dropping animations and effects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/94dfe52548c19216d3ee6245df44848b.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From heart-pounding combat to hilarious interactions, this game promises a journey packed with magic, mischief, and plenty of memorable moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let\u2019s Gay Rule!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to explore a beautifully queer reimagining of Arthurian legend in <i>The Chronicles of Lancelot 2 \u2013 The Adventure to Avalon.</i> With sizzling drama, captivating romance, and jaw-dropping twists, this isn\u2019t just another RPG\u2014it\u2019s a fabulous celebration of love, identity, and heroism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to save the prince, conquer Avalon, and rule the world with flair? Your next adventure begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/7165e838fde783d5a4f4f3b2c36aaa7a.poster.avif?t=1749196239\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/7165e838fde783d5a4f4f3b2c36aaa7a.webm?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/7165e838fde783d5a4f4f3b2c36aaa7a.mp4?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/5ab6ee51648da719fd91d96f84b9f552.avif?t=1749196239\" width=600 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/be4d909694d43ca7e851dc441465833f.webp?t=1749196239\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a larger, more vibrant world in <i>The Chronicles of Lancelot 2</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b5a84045b75f14cd8084fd5d889bb4d1.avif?t=1749196239\" width=616 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/aff0111b242fec89bef71ea558baee58.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, you\u2019ll explore the grand castle of Camelot, home to the kingdom's elite. Indulge in luxuries such as the royal theater, steamy saunas, tarot readings, and more. Beyond Camelot, venture into breathtaking new lands, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faldon Village</strong>, Jaime\u2019s tranquil hometown in the sky-bound kingdom of Pantheron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b7615fb48dc98143f9fdbafdb1f8973d.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gay Island Nation of Arcadion</strong>, a utopia of love, pride, and glittering festivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/4098e564471ad8f69ca132193e9236a8.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legendary Island of Avalon</strong>, shrouded in mystery, where ancient treasures and perilous secrets await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d37ae59056458b05b4f3764ec5aef98b.poster.avif?t=1749196239\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d37ae59056458b05b4f3764ec5aef98b.webm?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d37ae59056458b05b4f3764ec5aef98b.mp4?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is teeming with charm, lore, and plenty of surprises to uncover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b55139becc3ce155f28e55228612624e.avif?t=1749196239\" width=616 height=101 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merlin still struggles against the deadly effects of the Tear of God, leaving the responsibility of ruling the kingdom to the newly public couple, Arthur and Lancelot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/3999e5478a010c49e1e87eeb2bc7aff3.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, peace is short-lived as a dangerous new threat emerges\u2014Mordred, a long-lost adversary of the royal family, has escaped imprisonment and seeks revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As tensions rise and a series of catastrophes unfolds, Arthur, Lancelot, Jaime, and an unlikely ally, Kay, must journey to Avalon to retrieve its magical relics. These ancient artifacts are the key to saving Camelot and restoring balance to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/5730a0dd720d182421f141d74ba99690.avif?t=1749196239\" width=800 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Lancelot and his companions succeed in this perilous quest? Or will Mordred\u2019s vengeance plunge the realm into darkness?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/fd7caa12d0d2d5f6795ad1403b1c7808.avif?t=1749196239\" width=616 height=101 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet old and new faces in this thrilling sequel:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Returning Heroes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/224ab26599b10e1b901da3aef8478ebc.avif?t=1749196239\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The brave yet na\u00efve prince has finally professed his love for Lancelot, but shocking events lead him to imprison his beloved. What could drive him to such a choice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/ad50f252e76fd072810f2060ce86011f.avif?t=1749196239\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing his name and defeating Kay, Lancelot finds himself swept into yet another whirlwind of intrigue, drama, and peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d4b643cd2243166cbb909220cc80dec9.avif?t=1749196239\" width=500 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a traitor, Kay now finds himself reluctantly aiding Lancelot in the journey to Avalon. Can he earn redemption or will his scheming nature persist?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Allies and Rivals:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lady of the Lake</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.poster.avif?t=1749196239\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.webm?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/b52af71b31bc8d69deb6ef17fca42c44.mp4?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious figure appears in the form desired by those who seek her. She\u2019s imprisoned deep beneath Avalon, and freeing her will be no small feat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mordred</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.poster.avif?t=1749196239\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.webm?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/d6341d420bed84b97aabc634bc679d2d.mp4?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A master of stealth and deception, Mordred\u2019s family was hunted down by Uther, who adopted him out of guilt. Now, he seeks vengeance for their demise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Takumi</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.poster.avif?t=1749196239\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.webm?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/ead1cd9d3adf73b70464fd78d6530ce1.mp4?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A treasure hunter from the East, Takumi attempts to steal Avalon\u2019s treasure map but gets caught and imprisoned in Camelot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thaloris</strong>: The charismatic merman steward of the Lady of the Lake provides crucial information about Avalon\u2019s treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taliesin</strong>: Camelot\u2019s eccentric scholar invents a flying ship to aid Lancelot on his journey to Pantheron. His poetic wit remains as sharp as ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innika</strong>: A fallen angel bound to the Archangel Ramiel, Innika serves as a reminder of the high cost of redemption.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that\u2019s just the beginning\u2014dozens more intriguing characters await to charm, challenge, and sometimes frustrate you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building on the traditional turn-based RPG mechanics of the first game, <i>The Adventure to Avalon</i> adds exciting new features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Spells and Skills</strong>: Unleash more powerful magic and skills.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/18ea53c02da04efe3eb6ae14be5614a3.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kay as a Playable Ally</strong>: Experience combat from a fresh perspective with Kay\u2019s unique abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/1df10f8e727d48e016d8e4728f493ca8.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games Galore</strong>: Try your hand at treasure hunting, puzzles, or even competing in Avalon\u2019s flamboyant gay festivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Summoning System</strong>: Call upon legendary beings to aid you in battle, each with jaw-dropping animations and effects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/94dfe52548c19216d3ee6245df44848b.avif?t=1749196239\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From heart-pounding combat to hilarious interactions, this game promises a journey packed with magic, mischief, and plenty of memorable moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let\u2019s Gay Rule!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to explore a beautifully queer reimagining of Arthurian legend in <i>The Chronicles of Lancelot 2 \u2013 The Adventure to Avalon.</i> With sizzling drama, captivating romance, and jaw-dropping twists, this isn\u2019t just another RPG\u2014it\u2019s a fabulous celebration of love, identity, and heroism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to save the prince, conquer Avalon, and rule the world with flair? Your next adventure begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/7165e838fde783d5a4f4f3b2c36aaa7a.poster.avif?t=1749196239\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/7165e838fde783d5a4f4f3b2c36aaa7a.webm?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331580/extras/7165e838fde783d5a4f4f3b2c36aaa7a.mp4?t=1749196239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a new adventure in the world of Arthurian legends! Explore magical lands, ride dragons, find hidden treasures, and have fun with hot knights. Rescue the prince, face a powerful new enemy, save the world, and become the most fabulous gay knight in this NSFW RPG sequel. Let\u2019s gay rule! \ud83c\udf08\u2728",
